clean 25/25 env-match including lf52 claimed L10 -> LIVE L10 MATCH before attempting
any submit. Only then ran the real --submit: 25/25 re-confirmed, lf52 again LIVE L10
MATCH, scorecard bb3d2ed9 CLOSED, real leaderboard record created. Total claimed
levels 181 -> 183.

